# CVE-2026-111943 sits in the Go standard library compiled into the Paketo
# buildpack helper binaries that the builder image
# (paketobuildpacks/builder-noble-java-tiny) brings into every build. None of
# them is reachable from the application: the helpers only run inside the build
# sandbox, and the run image's Java process never serves their HTTP or TLS
# surfaces.
#
# Fixes exist in Go 1.26.10 / 1.27.3, but the newest builder (0.0.200) was built
# with Go 1.27.2. Remove this entry once Paketo rebuilds the builder with the
# patched toolchain.
CVE-2026-111943
